<title>UK: MOTOR RACING-VERSTAPPEN JOINS TYRRELL.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-VERSTAPPEN JOINS TYRRELL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutchman Jos Verstappen has joined the Tyrrell Formula One team for 1997 and will race alongside Finland's Mika Salo.</p>
<p>Verstappen has previously driven for Benetton, Simtek and Arrows. His best world championship finishes to date were two third places for Benetton in 1994.</p>
</text>
